id: pm-v0600g
title: Windows nightly merge-receipt classification test exceeds 60-second budget
description: "Full Nightly Validation run 36366344450 on branch ca3d4d788 failed Windows Node 24 shard 1/2 because the lossless receipt settlement integration test timed out at 60000 ms; 4428 other shard tests passed. The test performs many real CLI, Git, history and health operations in one temporary workspace, making its existing budget unsuitable under hosted Windows contention. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/36366344450"
