completed_at: "2026-09-28T02:35:22.519Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Inspect the failing hosted log and full integration test; set a bounded realistic Windows test budget without suppressing assertions; rerun focused integration and full nightly matrix; retain exact coverage gate
goal: project management = context management
objective: Nightly merge receipt validation distinguishes test duration from failed receipt behavior
value: Keep nightly Windows release evidence reliable
impact: Prevent an unrelated test budget from making the full nightly matrix untrusted
outcome: Windows shard completes the real receipt classification test within a measured budget
parent: pm-ul9rye
risk: high
severity: high
repro_steps: "Nightly 36366344450 Windows Node 24 shard 1/2 timed out in tests/integration/merge-receipt-health-classification.integration.spec.ts:504 at 60000 ms."
resolution: "Set the real long-form lossless receipt settlement test budget to 120 seconds while retaining every CLI, Git, history and health assertion."
expected_result: Windows nightly shard 1/2 completes the test and the full matrix and exact coverage remain green.
actual_result: "Nightly 36366344450 failed this test at 60000 ms; patched head e3ad1955b passed linked 5/5 and local full 9384-test exact coverage, PR Gates (coverage), and all seven Nightly Validation 36369419144 jobs including Windows shard 1/2."
